[See Table M for Math Placement](#Table_M)

Presents topics in power, polynomial, rational, exponential, and logarithmic functions, and systems of equations and inequalities. Credit will not be awarded for both MTH 161: Precalculus I and MTH 167: Precalculus with Trigonometry or equivalent. \*This is a Passport Transfer course. Lecture 3 hours. Total 3 hours per week.
